.SH NAME
pagination_label \- A single\-line label that never wraps (button, tab, sidebar and header labels)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
pagination_label(content: impl text::IntoFragment<'a>)
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
A single\-line label that never wraps (button, tab, sidebar and header labels). libadwaita ellipsizes; iced cannot, so we keep the full text and let the surrounding layout wrap or scroll instead of squeezing it.
.PP
Typography classes: \fB.title\-1\fR ... \fB.title\-4\fR, \fB.heading\fR, \fB.caption\fR, \fB.caption\-heading\fR, \fB.monospace\fR, \fB.dim\-label\fR.
.PP
The free functions use \fBTypography::default\fR; call the same\-named methods on a \fBTypography\fR to use custom sizes.
